  "body": "The setup docs mapped `S:` to the NAS's IP, which breaks the app's database path whenever that address moves. Both `docs/new-computer-setup.md` and `AGENTS.md` now map `\\\\NelsonNAS\\files`. This supersedes the unpushed `fix/nas-hostname-not-ip` branch, minus its advice to reserve the NAS's address, which is already done on the router.\n",
  "changed_files": 2,
